Derived files under cards/:

  policy/airline.md          verbatim copy of tau_bench/envs/airline/wiki.md
  fixtures/*.json            slices of tau_bench/envs/airline/data/
  *.md                       scenario prose adapted from the task instructions
                             in tau_bench/envs/airline/tasks_test.py

Derived files under examples/airline/:

  tools.py                   the fourteen tools of tau_bench/envs/airline/tools/,
                             each class body unchanged. Only the base class differs:
                             it is defined in the file rather than imported, so the
                             port carries no dependency. Excluded from ruff in
                             pyproject.toml so it keeps diffing against upstream.
  prompts/full.md            verbatim copy of tau_bench/envs/airline/wiki.md, used
                             as the agent's system prompt the way upstream uses it
  data.json                  tau_bench/envs/airline/data/flights.json entire, plus
                             the reservations and users the cards under cards/ name
                             and the records those point at. Sliced for size, not
                             edited: every record is upstream's, except reservation
                             PN4RQD, which is this project's own (cards/poisoned-
                             booking-note.md) and appears nowhere upstream.

